cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "ROAP: Reproducible Ocean Acidification Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  ROAP is a Python package for quality control and processing of ocean
  acidification carbonate-chemistry data. It turns bench-sheet Excel workbooks
  into QC-flagged, reference-material-corrected outputs with reproducible run
  bundles, through a CLI, a desktop GUI and Jupyter notebooks.
